		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Çà roule )))</p><div class="codebox"><pre><code>$ psql -h 192.168.0.10 -U yt -d landp_public                         
Password for user yt: 
psql (9.1.3)
Type &quot;help&quot; for help.

landp_public=&gt; select * from categories;
